# checkout of a branch, and an untracked file that would be overwritten.
I definitions.inc
> init
<<<
+ f.txt wug.txt
> add f.txt
<<<
> commit "f"
<<<
> branch other
<<<
> checkout other
<<<
+ g.txt wug.txt
> add g.txt
<<<
> commit "g on other"
<<<
> checkout master
<<<
* g.txt
+ g.txt notwug.txt
> checkout other
There is an untracked file in the way; delete it, or add and commit it first.
<<<
= g.txt notwug.txt
- g.txt
> checkout other
<<<
= g.txt wug.txt
